        "original_id": "2197b9c4-e5d0-551f-a0b4-65098a59f072",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Musicland Group, Musicland, Sam Goody, Suncoast Motion Picture Company, OnCue, Media Play, Best Buy, Sun Capital\n- Topics: ownership changes, retail chains, bankruptcy\n\nFacts:\n- Musicland Group, Inc. was an entertainment company that operated the Musicland, Sam Goody, Suncoast Motion Picture Company, OnCue, and Media Play superstore chains.\n- In 2000, Best Buy purchased Sam Goody.\n- In 2003, Sun Capital acquired Sam Goody.\n- In 2006, Sam Goody filed for bankruptcy and closed most of its stores.",
